    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just a slump though. I can feel it in my gut. It's like the talent is just... gone. I'm just a shell of the person who actually had something to say. If I keep going, I'm just going to be this pathetic person making mediocre stuff trying to chase a ghost. It's exhausting to even try anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
